# GMS shortens the cooldown for kills after a revival. This game has no window
# to count kills in, so the hyper just gives the seconds: 150 off a pact that
# goes from 1103 down to 900, a sixth of the cooldown at max level.
name: "Final Pact - Reduce Cooldown"
description: "Reduces the cooldown for reusing Final Pact."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_DARK_KNIGHT skill_order: 8 }
hyper: true
required_level: 165
max_level: 1
base { revive_cooldown_cut_seconds: 150 }
